{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4XtKtFvzvDfUXuSwpt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The key slides in. The tumblers turn. A click reverberates through old wood.*\n\n*I swing open slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of years, revealing what lies beyond—*\n\nA long corridor, dimly lit, stretching further than it should. The air that passes through me is cool, carrying the faint scent of stone and forgotten rain.\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":98,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}